From: LM-G820N Developer <dev@lmg820n.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] sensors: keep SSC operations in their owning main context

Bind deferred measurement signals and discovery timeouts to the sensor's
construction context. Wait for synchronous operations in the calling
thread's context instead of dispatching the process-wide default context.
This allows camera clients to collect accelerometer samples in a dedicated
worker without dispatching application callbacks from that worker.

